      "proof_gate": "SHOW",
      "lead_silence_s": 1.2,
      "narration_text": "Reduce the system to one particle. Trigger one birth and watch its complete life. The dot has a position, the mint vector shows velocity, and the purple vector shows acceleration. These are separate pieces of state.",
