      "proof_gate": "SHOW",
      "lead_silence_s": 1.2,
      "narration_text": "I turn on the diagnostic vectors. Mint shows velocity; purple shows acceleration. The particle moves along its velocity. Gravity changes that velocity. Two different jobs, even when the arrows share one dot.",
