      "lane": "capture",
      "proof_gate": "SHOW",
      "lead_silence_s": 1.2,
      "narration_text": "Set gravity to zero. The trajectories become straight. Restore positive gravity and they bend downward. In this two-dimensional scene, positive Y points down. The launch velocity begins upward, with negative Y.",
