      "act": "Motion Has Separate Knobs",
      "lane": "capture",
      "proof_gate": "SHOW",
      "lead_silence_s": 1.2,
      "narration_text": "These are the update lines. Velocity gains acceleration times delta. Position gains velocity times delta. Delta is elapsed time in seconds, so the units stay tied to time instead of to a frame count.",
