      "proof_gate": "SHOW",
      "lead_silence_s": 1.2,
      "narration_text": "Restore cleanup. The reverse loop can remove expired entries without skipping the next record. The count returns to its bounded population. This lab also caps storage at six hundred to contain the deliberate fault.",
